msgctxt "80_Employee"
msgid "Ah, Muto-sama. The platinum ring you inquired about the\\r\nother day is finally in."
msgstr "Muto-sama, esto llegó para usted. Es el anillo de platino que mencionó el otro día..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "92_Shoko"
msgid "Platinum...? Hmm, I do have the money for it..."
msgstr "¿Platino...? Podría comprarlo ahora, pero..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "104_Employee"
msgid "It's a very popular piece. I've already had a number of\\r\ncustomers asking after it, but I put it aside especially for\\r\nyou."
msgstr "Es un artículo muy popular. Ahora mismo tuvimos a varios clientes preguntando por él... Sin embargo, este de acá está reservado especialmente para usted."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "116_Shoko"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "128_Employee"
msgid "I believe it's your size. Would you care to purchase it\\r\ntoday, Muto-sama?"
msgstr "Creo que es de su talla, ¿lo comprará el día de hoy, Muto-sama?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "140_Shoko"
msgid "No, that's all right. I'll come back when I can pay for it\\r\nmyself."
msgstr "No, estoy bien. Vendré cuando pueda pagarlo con mi propio dinero."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "152_Employee"
msgid "I see. I'm terribly sorry, but I can't guarantee it will be\\r\nhere on your next visit."
msgstr "Ya veo... Espero que pueda comprender que no se lo vamos a poder reservar."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Karu2nd
#. y4:reviewed_by=Karu2nd
msgctxt "164_Shoko"
msgid "That's fine... Thank you."
msgstr "Está bien... Gracias de todas formas."

